⍝ ==== s2 vow prover (Addendum A.5.1), deliberately weak
⍝ A vow is proven when its measure is a linear function of the values it sees, and every
⍝ way round the loop (or to a recursive call) leaves it at least 0 and at least 1 lower. The
⍝ prover runs the body over symbols: a value is a block [tag c a₀ … a_d−1] meaning
⍝ c + Σ aᵢ·xᵢ (tag 0), the trit of its sign (tag 1, from ≶), or unknown (tag 2). The
⍝ symbols are the loop's stack (or the function's inputs) when they are ℤ, then 8 for the
⍝ ℤ moments of the enclosing block that the loop borrows. ⋔ on a trit splits the run into
⍝ paths, each with the facts its face implies (a chain [next f] of affine f ≥ 0); anything
⍝ else the prover does not follow leaves unknowns of the right number, as the checker
⍝ recorded the depths (‹setdepth›). A fact proves a ≥ 0 when a − λ·f is a constant ≥ 0 for
⍝ some whole λ ≥ 1. A measure that provably does not fall on a path that can be taken is
⍝ perjury. Addenda state slots: 7 the stack symbols, 8 the status (0 proven so far, 1
⍝ unknown, 2 perjury), 9 the function's name (−1 for a ⥀), 10 the vow node, 11 the
⍝ measure on entry, 12 flags (1: some paths were not followed, 2: a path ends in ↯), 13 the
⍝ enclosing strand (for its moments' types). A path is [S strand F vague]: vague once it
⍝ went through something the prover does not follow, so it cannot convict a vow of perjury.

⍝ ---- affine values

⍝ ‹pvd› C: the number of symbols
⦃ #7# ‹a2› #8# ⊞ ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹pvd› ⸫
⍝ ‹afnew› C tag c: c, with every coefficient 0
⦃
  ⧖:C,tag,c
  ⧗:C̵ ‹pvd› ⧖:C,d
  ⧗:C̵ ‹len› ⧖:C,b
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:tag ⍆̵ ⧗:c ⍆̵ ⧗:d
  ⥀ ⦃ ⧖:C,j ⧗:C̵,j ⧗:j ○ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:C,j ⧗:C̵ ○ ⍆̵ ⧗:j △ ⊟ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦄ ⌁
  ⧗:b
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹afnew› ⸫
⦃ ⧖:C ⧗:C̵ #2# ○ ‹afnew› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹afunk› ⸫
⍝ ‹afvar› C i: the symbol xᵢ
⦃ ⧖:C,i ⧗:C̵ ○ ○ ‹afnew› ⧖:C,b ⧗:C̵ ⧗:b #2# ⊞ ⧗:i ⊞ △ ‹wr› ⧗:b ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹afvar› ⸫
⍝ ‹afc› C a: the constant; ‹aftag› C a: the tag
⦃ ⧖:C,a ⧗:C̵ ⧗:a △ ⊞ ‹rd› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹afc› ⸫
⦃ ‹rd› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹aftag› ⸫
⍝ ‹afcomb› C a b s: a + s·b (unknown unless both are affine)
⦃
  ⧖:C,a,b,s
  ⧗:C̵,a ‹aftag› ⧖:C,ta ⧗:C̵,b ‹aftag› ⧖:C,tb
  ⧗:C̵,a,b,s ⧗:ta ○ ᛖ ⧗:tb ○ ᛖ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ‹afcomb1› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ‹afunk› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹afcomb› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,a,b,s
  ⧗:C̵ ‹pvd› ⧖:C,d
  ⧗:C̵ ‹len› ⧖:C,r ⧗:C̵ ○ ⍆̵ ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,a,b,s,r ○ ⧗:d △ ⊞
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,a,b,s,r,j,n
    ⧗:C̵,a,b,s,r,j,n ⧗:j ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ‹afcomb2› ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⧖:r ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⧗:r
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹afcomb1› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,a,b,s,r,j,n
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:a △ ⊞ ⧗:j ⊞ ‹rd› ⧖:C,x
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:b △ ⊞ ⧗:j ⊞ ‹rd› ⧖:C,y
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:x ⧗:s ⧗:y ⊠ ⊞ ⍆̵
  ⧗:a,b,s,r ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:n
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹afcomb2› ⸫
⍝ ‹afscale› C a n: n·a
⦃ ⧖:C,a,n ⧗:C̵ ○ ○ ‹afnew› ⧖:C,z ⧗:C̵,z,a,n ‹afcomb› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹afscale› ⸫
⍝ ‹afsign› C a b: the trit of a − b
⦃
  ⧖:C,a,b
  ⧗:C̵,a,b #-1# ‹afcomb› ⧖:C,g
  ⧗:C̵,g ‹aftag› ⧖:C,t
  ⧗:C̵,g ⧗:t ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:C,gg ⧗:C̵ ⧗:gg △ ‹wr› ⧗:gg ⦄ ∅ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹afsign› ⸫
⍝ ‹afg› C t: the value whose sign trit t is, as an affine value
⦃ ⧖:C,t ⧗:C̵ ⧗:t ○ ‹wr› ⧖:C ⧗:C̵,t △ ‹afscale› ⧖:C,g ⧗:C̵ ⧗:t △ ‹wr› ⧗:g ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹afg› ⸫
⍝ ‹afisconst› C a: affine with every coefficient 0
⦃
  ⧖:C,a
  ⧗:C̵ ‹pvd› ⧖:C,d
  ⧗:C̵,a ‹aftag› ⧖:C,t
  ⧗:C̵,a ○ ⧗:d ○ ⧗:t ᛖ
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,a,j,d,ok
    ⧗:C̵,a,j,d,ok ⧗:j ⧗:d ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ‹afconst1› ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,a,j,d,ok ⧗:C̵,ok
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ŧ⟩ ‹afisconst› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,a,j,d,ok
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:a #2# ⊞ ⧗:j ⊞ ‹rd› ⧖:C,x
  ⧗:C̵,a ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:d ⧗:ok ⧗:x ○ ᛖ ⋎ ⊕
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ŧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ŧ ŧ⟩ ‹afconst1› ⸫
⍝ ‹affirst› C f: the first symbol with a coefficient, or −1
⦃
  ⧖:C,f
  ⧗:C̵ ‹pvd› ⧖:C,d
  ⧗:C̵,f ○ ⧗:d #-1#
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,f,j,d,r
    ⧗:C̵,f,j,d,r ⧗:j ⧗:d ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ‹affirst1› ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,f,j,d,r ⧗:C̵,r
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹affirst› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,f,j,d,r
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:f #2# ⊞ ⧗:j ⊞ ‹rd› ⧖:C,x
  ⧗:C̵,f ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:d ⧗:r ⧗:j ⧗:r #-1# ᛖ ⧗:x ○ ᛖ ‹not› ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹affirst1› ⸫

⍝ ---- facts

⍝ ‹afgeq› C a F: a ≥ 0 follows from the facts F
⦃
  ⧖:C,a,F
  ⧗:C̵,a ‹aftag› ⧖:C,t
  ⧗:C̵,a,F ⧗:t ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹afgeq1› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ŧ⟩ ‹afgeq› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,a,F
  ⧗:C̵,a ‹afisconst› ⧖:C,isc
  ⧗:C̵,a ‹afc› ⧖:C,c
  ⧗:C̵,a,F ○ ⧗:c ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⧗:isc ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ‹afgeqf› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ŧ⟩ ‹afgeq1› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,a,F
  ⧗:C̵,a,F ⊕
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,a,e,found
    ⧗:C̵,a,e,found ⧗:e #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄
      ⦃ ⧖:C,a,e,found ⧗:C̵,e ‹rd› ⧖:C,nx ⧗:C̵ ⧗:e △ ⊞ ‹rd› ⧖:C,f ⧗:C̵,a,f ‹afdom› ⧖:C,ok ⧗:C̵,a,nx ⧗:found ⧗:ok ⋏ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,a,e,found ⧗:C̵,found
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ŧ⟩ ‹afgeqf› ⸫
⍝ ‹afdom› C a f: a = λ·f + c for a whole λ ≥ 1 and c ≥ 0, so f ≥ 0 gives a ≥ 0
⦃
  ⧖:C,a,f
  ⧗:C̵,f ‹affirst› ⧖:C,i
  ⧗:C̵,a,f,i ⧗:i #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ‹afdom1› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ŧ⟩ ‹afdom› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,a,f,i
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:a #2# ⊞ ⧗:i ⊞ ‹rd› ⧖:C,ai
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:f #2# ⊞ ⧗:i ⊞ ‹rd› ⧖:C,fi
  ⧗:ai ⧗:fi ⊘ ⁇ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ ○ ⦄ ⧖:lam
  ⧗:C̵,a,f ⧗:lam ⊝ ‹afcomb› ⧖:C,r
  ⧗:C̵,r ‹afisconst› ⧖:C,isc ⧗:C̵,r ‹afc› ⧖:C,c
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:isc ⧗:lam △ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⋎ ○ ⧗:c ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⋎
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ŧ⟩ ‹afdom1› ⸫
⍝ ‹pvfact› C F a: F and a ≥ 0
⦃ ⧖:C,F,a ⧗:C̵ ‹len› ⧖:C,e ⧗:C̵ ⧗:F ⍆̵ ⧗:a ⍆̵ ⧗:e ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹pvfact› ⸫
⍝ ‹pvfeasible› C F: the facts can all hold (every constant one does, and at most one is not
⍝ constant), so a path with them can be taken
⦃
  ⧖:C,F
  ⧗:C̵,F ○ ⦶
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,e,nv,ok
    ⧗:C̵,e,nv,ok ⧗:e #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ‹pvfeas1› ⊕ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,e,nv,ok ⧗:C̵ ⧗:ok ⧗:nv #2# ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⋎
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ŧ⟩ ‹pvfeasible› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,e,nv,ok
  ⧗:C̵,e ‹rd› ⧖:C,nx ⧗:C̵ ⧗:e △ ⊞ ‹rd› ⧖:C,f
  ⧗:C̵,f ‹afisconst› ⧖:C,isc ⧗:C̵,f ‹afc› ⧖:C,c
  ⧗:C̵,nx ⧗:nv ⧗:isc ⋔ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ △ ⊞ ⦄ ⁼ ⧗:ok ⧗:isc ‹not› ○ ⧗:c ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⋏ ⋎
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ŧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ŧ⟩ ‹pvfeas1› ⸫

⍝ ---- paths [S strand F vague]

⦃ ⧖:C,S,st,F,v ⧗:C̵ ‹len› ⧖:C,p ⧗:C̵ ⧗:S ⍆̵ ⧗:st ⍆̵ ⧗:F ⍆̵ ⧗:v ⍆̵ ⧗:p ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹pvmk› ⸫
⦃ ‹rd› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹pvS› ⸫
⦃ △ ‹vf› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹pvst› ⸫
⦃ #2# ‹vf› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹pvF› ⸫
⦃ #3# ‹vf› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹pvv› ⸫
⍝ ‹pvwith› C p S: p with the stack S, as a list of one path
⦃
  ⧖:C,p,S
  ⧗:C̵,p ‹pvst› ⧖:C,st ⧗:C̵,p ‹pvF› ⧖:C,F ⧗:C̵,p ‹pvv› ⧖:C,v
  ⧗:C̵,S,st,F,v ‹pvmk› ‹l1›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹pvwith› ⸫
⍝ ‹pvunks› C S n: S then n unknowns
⦃
  ⧖:C,S,n
  ⧗:C̵,S,n
  ⥀ ⦃ ⧖:C,S,j ⧗:C̵,S,j ⧗:j ○ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:C,S,j ⧗:C̵ ‹afunk› ⧖:C,u ⧗:C̵,S,u ‹lpush› ⧖:C,S2 ⧗:C̵,S2 ⧗:j △ ⊟ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦄
  ⌁
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹pvunks› ⸫
⍝ ‹pvstop› C: the prover gives up (the vow stays hopeful); no paths go on
⦃ ⧖:C ⧗:C̵ #8# ‹a2› ⧖:C,s ⧗:C̵ #8# ⧗:s △ ‹max› ‹a2w› #1# ‹pvflag› ‹lnew0› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹pvstop› ⸫
⦃ ⧖:C,b ⧗:C̵ #12# ‹a2› ⧖:C,fl ⧗:C̵ #12# ⧗:fl ⧗:b ⋓ ‹a2w› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹pvflag› ⸫

⍝ ---- running blocks over paths

⍝ ‹pvblock› C from to L: the paths after the ops from … to−1
⦃
  ⧖:C,from,to,L
  ⧗:C̵,from,to,L
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,i,to,L
    ⧗:C̵,i,to,L ⧗:i ⧗:to ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ‹pvstep› ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,i,to,L ⧗:C̵,L
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹pvblock› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,i,to,L
  ⧗:C̵,i,L ‹pvmap› ⧖:C,L2
  ⧗:C̵,i ‹nextn› ⧖:C,nx
  ⧗:C̵,nx,to,L2
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹pvstep› ⸫
⍝ ‹pvmap› C op L: op on every path; past 64 paths the prover gives up
⦃
  ⧖:C,op,L
  ⧗:C̵ ‹lnew0› ⧖:C,R
  ⧗:C̵,L ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,op,L,R ○ ⧗:n
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,op,L,R,j,n
    ⧗:C̵,op,L,R,j,n ⧗:j ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,op,L,R,j,n ⧗:C̵,L,j ‹lget› ⧖:C,p ⧗:C̵,op,p ‹pvop1› ⧖:C,P ⧗:C̵,R,P ‹lcat› ⧖:C,R2 ⧗:C̵,op,L,R2 ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,op,L,R,j,n
  ⧗:C̵,R ‹llen› ⧖:C,nr
  ⧗:C̵,R ⧗:nr #64# ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ‹pvstop› ⦄ ⦃ ⦄
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹pvmap› ⸫
⍝ ‹pvblockin› C b p: block node b run on path p; it sees p's moments, and its own end with it
⦃
  ⧖:C,b,p
  ⧗:C̵,p ‹pvst› ⧖:C,st0
  ⧗:C̵,b ‹brange› ⧖:C,from,to
  ⧗:C̵,p ‹l1› ⧖:C,L
  ⧗:C̵,from,to,L ‹pvblock› ⧖:C,R
  ⧗:C̵ ‹lnew0› ⧖:C,Q
  ⧗:C̵,R ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,R,Q,st0 ○ ⧗:n
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,R,Q,st0,j,n
    ⧗:C̵,R,Q,st0,j,n ⧗:j ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,R,Q,st0,j,n ⧗:C̵,R,j ‹lget› ⧖:C,q ⧗:C̵,q ‹pvS› ⧖:C,S ⧗:C̵,q ‹pvF› ⧖:C,F ⧗:C̵,q ‹pvv› ⧖:C,v
        ⧗:C̵,S,st0,F,v ‹pvmk› ⧖:C,q2 ⧗:C̵,Q,q2 ‹lpush› ⧖:C,Q2 ⧗:C̵,R,Q2,st0 ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,R,Q,st0,j,n ⧗:C̵,Q
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹pvblockin› ⸫

⍝ ‹pvop1› C op p: the paths after one op
⦃
  ⧖:C,op,p
  ⧗:C̵,op ○ ‹nd› ⧖:C,k
  ⧗:C̵,op,p,k
  ⍿⁰ △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹pv_lit› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ #2# ᛖ ⍿¹ #6# ᛖ ⋏ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹pv_call› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ #5# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹pv_op› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ #10# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹pv_select› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ #24# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⧖:C,o,pp ⧗:C̵ ⧗:o #3# ⊞ ⧗:pp ‹pvblockin› ⦄ ⦃
